Subject: [PATCH 1/7] feat(rag): add optional MLflow tracking to the retrieval
 evaluation

Add rag/tracking.py and a --mlflow flag on rag.eval that logs params
(embedding model, dataset size/hash), headline and per-slice metrics and
the full JSON report as an artifact. MLflow stays an optional extra
(uv sync --extra tracking).
